"use": "food supermarket that is also a konbini (user, 2026-09-28): INTERIOR = kits/shops/Shop_Supermarket.blend (piece Supermarket_Interior, the artist's): the sales floor (produce, six gondola runs, a frozen island, dairy / drinks cases, the deli counters fed by the kitchen's pass windows, meat and fish cases, six checkout lanes and bagging tables, a konbini corner with the service counter, hot snacks, coffee, ATM, copier and an eat-in counter, two customer accessible restrooms); the BACKYARD (receiving with the delivery doors, the back corridor, walk-in cooler and freezer, meat & fish prep, the deli kitchen where the food is made, the office with the safe, lockers, the staff restroom off the staff aisle and its exit). The loading yard (荷捌き場) is the SupermarketSite composite.",
